maria: action items: I'll take docs and sample. Ben/Alejandro draft SDK exception mapping RFC this week. Sophie update onboarding checklist to include error handling.

ben: will post RFC in #devex by EOD.

sophie: will patch sample app and add e2e asserting we surface retry_after.

alejandro: will fix export and add Go mapping unit tests.

maria: thanks — should reduce onboarding friction. :raised_hands:
